  "details": "[FEEDBACK] Hello, excuse my english.  I have a problem and I don't know who to ask for help, my avatars are disappearing (vrchat prohibits them), clearly I have the projects to re-upload them, but I have no idea what could be happening, nor how to find out what I'm doing wrong to fix it.  I don't think my avatars violate vrchat policies, they are small, cute avatars, without animations or music, with their quests version and as optimized as possible.  They are not sexualized, nor do they have gore, nor violence, some I have made public, but why?\n\n I'm not the only one who has had small avatars disappear.  So he asked me if we are breaking any rules by having small avatars? If so, we would like you to be clear on that point.\n\n Where can I get information because they take away my avatars, because they don't send any email, or notice of non-compliance.  I hope you can help me in some way, thank you.",
